import{_ as o,o as n,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 719 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 719 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post","no":719,"module":4,"tags":["Post Duties","New-Cosmos Frontier","Law Weaving","New-Cosmos Design","Law Self-Consistency"],"related":["80-Plane Theory and Classification","62-Spatial-Law Technical Implementation","13-Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0719_模块4-新宇宙开拓与法则编织岗.md","filePath":"en/0719_模块4-新宇宙开拓与法则编织岗.md"}`),s={name:"en/0719_模块4-新宇宙开拓与法则编织岗.md"};function a(r,e,l,c,h,d){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-719-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-new-cosmos-frontier-and-law-weaving-post" tabindex="-1">Entry 719 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-719-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-new-cosmos-frontier-and-law-weaving-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 719 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 80, 62, 13</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-most-romantic-post-does-the-most-rigorous-work" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the most romantic post does the most rigorous work <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-most-romantic-post-does-the-most-rigorous-work" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the most romantic post does the most rigorous work&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Of the nine posts, the most romantic is the New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post. Its name sounds like a novel — &quot;weaving a new cosmos&quot; — but what it does is the most rigorous of the nine posts. Because <strong>what you weave is not a dream, but a real cosmos that will carry billions of beings.</strong> One law woven wrong may be the disaster of the entire new cosmos. In old web novels this post corresponds to &quot;Creator God,&quot; but old web novels&#39; Creator God pinches a world at will, and if pinched wrong destroys it and starts over; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Law-Weaving Post — every law must go through hundred-fold deduction, isolated-space testing, and cross-post deliberation before daring to land.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into the word &quot;weaving&quot;: the law-first axiom is directly this post&#39;s parent law — newly woven laws must be self-consistent, stable, and infinitely scalable; the anti-predation axiom requires the new cosmos not become a new predation ground; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the new cosmos&#39;s design be equal to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires the new cosmos&#39;s results feed back to Myriad Ranks; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the weaving process not disturb existing cosmoses&#39; causality.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-post-positioning-the-new-cosmos-s-chief-architect" tabindex="-1">I. Post Positioning: The New Cosmos&#39;s &quot;Chief Architect&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-post-positioning-the-new-cosmos-s-chief-architect" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Post Positioning: The New Cosmos&#39;s &quot;Chief Architect&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Law-Weaving Post transcended ones&#39; work is to design, weave, and test new cosmoses (or new law sectors). This is not imagination out of thin air, but a strict engineering:</p><ul><li><strong>Raising demand</strong>: in which law dimensions are existing cosmoses insufficient? Which clans and which cultivation paths need new law support?</li><li><strong>Law design</strong>: design the new cosmos&#39;s physical constants, energy rules, time dimension, consciousness-domain characteristics;</li><li><strong>Self-consistency verification</strong>: use hundred-fold deduction to test whether the new law combination is self-consistent, whether there are logical contradictions;</li><li><strong>Isolated testing</strong>: build a miniature new cosmos in an isolated space (Document 64), test its operation;</li><li><strong>Safety audit</strong>: jointly by the Alaya Supervision Post (715) and Civilizational-Correction Post (716) audit the new cosmos&#39;s safety risks;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank deliberation</strong>: by the Deliberation Coordination Post (718) organize Myriad-Rank representatives to deliberate the new-cosmos scheme;</li><li><strong>Landing weave</strong>: after approval, formally weave the new cosmos into the law network.</li></ul><p>Only after seven steps are complete does a new cosmos truly begin to exist.</p><h2 id="ii-why-new-cosmoses-must-be-woven-by-transcended-ones" tabindex="-1">II. Why New Cosmoses Must Be Woven by Transcended Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-new-cosmoses-must-be-woven-by-transcended-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why New Cosmoses Must Be Woven by Transcended Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Weaving a new cosmos is not artistic creation; it requires <strong>Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm-level law understanding</strong>. An Origin-Realm strong one may only understand existing cosmoses&#39; laws; a Multiverse-Realm strong one may dispatch laws cross-cosmos; only a Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm transcended one may, starting from the law network&#39;s bottom layer, personally hand-weave a new world.</p><p>This understanding requirement means: Law-Weaving Post transcended ones must be <strong>the law-first axiom&#39;s most pious executors</strong>. He knows the consequence of any law woven wrong — not &quot;this world collapses&quot; as in novels, but that billions of beings in this world will struggle, go astray, and reincarnate inside a self-inconsistent law. Therefore he must restrain romance and insist on rigor.</p><h2 id="iii-the-fundamental-difference-between-weaving-and-predation" tabindex="-1">III. The Fundamental Difference Between Weaving and Predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-fundamental-difference-between-weaving-and-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Fundamental Difference Between Weaving and Predation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In old web novels, &quot;creation&quot; is often written as an advanced version of predation — I create a world; the people in it are all mine; I let them live and they live; I let them die and they die. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Law-Weaving Post rejects this writing from the root:</p><ul><li>The new cosmos is not the weaver&#39;s private property; once woven it is immediately connected to the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle;</li><li>Beings in the new cosmos have equal evolution qualification, not subject to the weaver&#39;s personal will;</li><li>The weaver&#39;s responsibility for the new cosmos is perpetual — he must continuously maintain it, not &quot;pinch and leave&quot;;</li><li>All of the new cosmos&#39;s law design is subject to Myriad Ranks&#39; right to deliberate and request modification.</li></ul><p>This transforms &quot;creation&quot; from theocratic behavior into <strong>public-engineering behavior</strong>. The weaver is not a god; he is the new cosmos&#39;s chief engineer.</p><h2 id="iv-cooperation-with-the-cross-plane-anchor-construction-post" tabindex="-1">IV. Cooperation with the Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cooperation-with-the-cross-plane-anchor-construction-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cooperation with the Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Law-Weaving Post (719) and the Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post (714) form a complete closed loop:</p><ul><li>The Cross-Plane Post <strong>onboards already existing</strong> planes into the anchor network;</li><li>The Law-Weaving Post designs <strong>not-yet-existing</strong> new cosmoses;</li><li>After the new cosmos is woven, the Cross-Plane Post is responsible for onboarding it into Myriad Ranks&#39; territory;</li><li>Existing-law insufficiency found in existing cosmoses is fed back to the Law-Weaving Post as input for new-cosmos design.</li></ul><p>One onboarding, one weaving; Myriad Ranks&#39; territory grows larger and larger.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: pre-weaving hundred-fold deduction and isolated testing avoid a self-inconsistent new cosmos wasting billions of beings&#39; cultivation</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the new cosmos is not the weaver&#39;s private property; after joining the Myriad-Rank cycle it belongs to all beings</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style creation is theocratic behavior; whatever the protagonist pinches is what it is; Heng Yuan Zhou-style creation is public engineering; the seven-step process is indispensable</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the new cosmos&#39;s design demand comes from Myriad-Rank representatives; all beings in the new cosmos enjoy equal qualification</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the new cosmos&#39;s law design, test data, and operating parameters are all public in the Selfless-Dao public library</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s territorial expansion&#39;s forwardmost front. It is most romantic, also most rigorous; most creative, also most procedural. It reminds every strong one pursuing &quot;creation&quot;: <strong>you are not a god; you are an engineer; your work is not a toy, but billions of beings&#39; home.</strong> Before weaving a law, first think clearly whom this law will support.</p><p>In the end, the New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post described in this entry is no isolated case — its causal and energetic traces are throughout filed in the Alaya Network, traceable and correctable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">Entry 80 · Plane Theory and Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/62-空间法理技术实现.html">Entry 62 · Spatial-Law Technical Implementation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">Entry 13 · Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/64-隔离空间构建技术.html">Entry 64 · Isolated-Space Construction Technology</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=o(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
